Id":5113,"speakerName":"ブラシーネ","textMapHash":2620210626,"text":"…シュテルさん、この辺りはもう何回も探しただろ？多分、バレアはもう大自然に向かって行っちゃったんだと思うぞ。","nextNodeIds":[240010114]},{"nodeId":240010114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5019,"speakerName":"シュテル","textMapHash":3302982610,"text":"では、わたくしたちも大自然を目指しましょう！","nextNodeIds":[240010115]},{"nodeId":240010115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5113,"speakerName":"ブラシーネ","textMapHash":4175330634,"text":"きみは街に残っててくれ。そのドレスじゃ、バレアを見つけたって追いつけやしないよ。","nextNodeIds":[240010116]},{"nodeId":240010116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5019,"speakerName":"シュテル","textMapHash":4003204466,"text":"そんなことはありませんわ。わたくしの声を聞けば、たちまちこっちに走ってきてくれるはずです！","nextNodeIds":[240010117]},{"nodeId":240010117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5113,"speakerName":"ブラシーネ","textMapHash":2139652674,"text":"じゃあ、さっき私たちが歌劇場の周りで大声で呼びながら探してた時は、きっとバレアに声が届かなかったんだろうな。","nextNodeIds":[240010118]},{"nodeId":240010118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5113,"speakerName":"ブラシーネ","textMapHash":3387537202,"text":"バレアが大人しくシュテルさんのところに帰るかなあ…私一人じゃとても返せそうにないぞ…","nextNodeIds":[240010119]},{"nodeId":240010119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5113,"speakerName":"ブラシーネ","textMapHash":2388746298,"text":"私も勤務中だから、持ち場をあまり長く離れるわけにはいかないし、ましてや同僚を私と一緒に持ち場から離れさせるわけにもいかない…","nextNodeIds":[240010120]},{"nodeId":240010120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5113,"speakerName":"ブラシーネ","textMapHash":3383726562,"text":"旅人、もしよかったら、私とシュテルさんに手を貸してくれないか？","nextNodeIds":[240010121,240010122]},{"nodeId":240010121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2360446874,"text":"別に構わないけど…","nextNodeIds":[240010124]},{"nodeId":240010124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5113,"speakerName":"ブラシーネ","textMapHash":2142616546,"text":"じゃ、決まりな。私と一緒に野外でバレアを探してくれ。","nextNodeIds":[240010125]},{"nodeId":240010125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5113,"speakerName":"ブラシーネ","textMapHash":770244418,"text":"バレアの体重と体力からすれば、あんまり遠くへは行ってないはず。","nextNodeIds":[240010126]},{"nodeId":240010126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5019,"speakerName":"シュテル","textMapHash":1253088178,"text":"バレアは至って健康ですわ！","nextNodeIds":[240010127]},{"nodeId":240010127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5113,"speakerName":"ブラシーネ","textMapHash":751914146,"text":"バレアの精神状態について言ってるのなら、私も賛成だけどさ。","nextNodeIds":[240010128]},{"nodeId":240010128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5113,"speakerName":"ブラシーネ","textMapHash":2048455498,"text":"じゃあ出発しよう。もし外の楽しさを知ってしまったら、バレアがさらに遠くまで行っちゃうかもしれない。","nextNodeIds":[240010129]},{"nodeId":240010129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5019,"speakerName":"シュテル","textMapHash":607197322,"text":"まあ！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":240010122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":876459266,"text":"こんなこともおまわりさんの仕事なの？","nextNodeIds":[240010123]},{"nodeId":240010123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5113,"speakerName":"ブラシーネ","textMapHash":3798190898,"text":"フォンテーヌ廷の市民が助けを求めてきた以上、断る理由もないからな。","nextNodeIds":[240010124]},{"nodeId":240010109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":8505210,"text":"何かトラブル？","nextNodeIds":[240010110]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2400101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["5019"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":2400102,"order":2,"stepDescription":"ブラシーネについて行く","stepDescTextMapHash":3025374588,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2400102,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""